{"run_id":"20260911T161706Z","sample_id":"cap_001","run_index":0,"k":5,"timestamp_utc":"2026-09-11T16:17:33+00:00","answer_type":"closed","question":"信贷风控项目里，PSI 达到多少会被判定为显著漂移并触发告警？","answer":"按项目技术规格书的约定，PSI 阈值分三档：\n\n- **< 0.1**：稳定\n- **0.1 ~ 0.25**：轻微漂移\n- **> 0.25**：显著漂移，触发告警\n\n阈值放在 config 中可配置。验收要求是：注入漂移后，显著特征的 PSI 越过告警线（>0.25）并被标记。","tool_sequence":["retrieve"],"retrieved_doc_ids":["c730fa5c_0027","c730fa5c_0028","c730fa5c_0004","c730fa5c_0037"],"stop_reason":"answered","n_steps":2,"latency":{"total_s":2.287642799994501,"llm_s":2.1568874999939,"retrieve_s":0.12490220000472618,"tool_s":0.0,"n_llm_calls":2,"n_retrieve_calls":1,"n_tool_calls":0,"llm_call_s":[0.9013932999951066,1.2554941999987932],"overhead_s":0.0058530999958748},"tokens":{"prompt":2078,"completion":144,"total":2222,"cache_hit":1664,"cache_miss":414},"error":null,"response_model":"deepseek-flash","system_fingerprint":"aeb56401ca74e127821c4f9126dcb669","tool_sequence_collapsed":["retrieve"],"answer_sha1":"8a1af82233e0"}
{"run_id":"20260911T161706Z","sample_id":"cap_006","run_index":0,"k":5,"timestamp_utc":"2026-09-11T16:17:36+00:00","answer_type":"closed","question":"信贷项目里 PSI 的显著漂移阈值，减去轻微漂移区间的下限，差值是多少？","answer":"差值是 **0.15**（0.25 − 0.1）。\n\n依据：技术规格书第 11 节漂移监控规格中约定 PSI 阈值 `<0.1` 稳定、`0.1~0.25` 轻微、`>0.25` 显著漂移。","tool_sequence":["retrieve","retrieve","calc"],"retrieved_doc_ids":["c730fa5c_0027","c730fa5c_0028","c730fa5c_0004","c730fa5c_0037","c730fa5c_0034"],"stop_reason":"answered","n_steps":3,"latency":{"total_s":3.4477203999995254,"llm_s":3.166625700010627,"retrieve_s":0.27852939999866067,"tool_s":0.00004780000017490238,"n_llm_calls":3,"n_retrieve_calls":2,"n_tool_calls":1,"llm_call_s":[1.2514337000029627,1.196130100004666,0.7190619000029983],"overhead_s":0.002517499990062788},"tokens":{"prompt":5671,"completion":277,"total":5948,"cache_hit":3200,"cache_miss":2471},"error":null,"response_model":"deepseek-flash","system_fingerprint":"aeb56401ca74e127821c4f9126dcb669","tool_sequence_collapsed":["retrieve","calc"],"answer_sha1":"9eab2c0c778b"}
{"run_id":"20260911T161706Z","sample_id":"cap_007","run_index":0,"k":5,"timestamp_utc":"2026-09-11T16:17:42+00:00","answer_type":"open","question":"信贷风控项目和航班延误项目，各自是怎么防止数据泄露的？","answer":"两个项目防数据泄露的做法，检索到的依据如下：\n\n## 信贷风控项目\n\n规格书里没有单列\"防泄露\"章节，相关约束散落在几处：\n\n- **预处理无泄露**：`Preprocessor.fit(X_train)` / `transform(X)` 分离，验收标准明确写\"无泄露；预处理器可序列化并复用\"（第 6 节）。\n- **数据与工件不入库**：`.gitignore` 排除 `data/raw/`、`data/processed/`、`*.csv`、`mlruns/`、`outputs/models/`、`*.pkl`、`.env`；提交前必须就位，数据、mlruns、模型工件**不提交**（第 19.2 节）。\n- **服务层输入校验**：FastAPI + Pydantic 校验（第 5 节技术选型表）。\n\n## 航班延误项目\n\n防泄露写得最明确，集中在特征工程（第 7 节，原文\"**严禁数据泄露**\"）：\n\n- `airport_congestion`：只用**计划信息**（起飞时刻 ±30min 窗口内计划起飞架次），无泄露。\n- `carrier_ontime_rate`：承运人历史准点率用 **out-of-fold / 仅训练集统计**（在第 8 节 CV 内计算）。\n- 风险分级切点：`fit_quantiles(train_pred)` 由**训练集**定切点，测试集复用（第 9 节）。\n- 架构图标注 `[features] 7 核心特征 + 3 交互特征（防泄露）`。\n\n## 小结\n\n- 共同点：都强调**训练/测试分离**、统计量只在训练集上拟合。\n- 差异：航班项目把防泄露写进了特征定义（计划信息、OOF 统计、训练集切点）；信贷项目主要靠 fit/transform 分离 + 数据工件不提交 + 服务层校验。\n\n需要说明的是，信贷项目规格书中**没有**专门针对\"数据泄露\"的独立章节或验收条款，以上是从预处理、`.gitignore`、服务校验等条目归纳的。","tool_sequence":["retrieve","retrieve","retrieve","retrieve"],"retrieved_doc_ids":["c730fa5c_0010","c730fa5c_0035","c730fa5c_0037","c730fa5c_0018","2da65ad3_0003","2da65ad3_0008","2da65ad3_0018","2da65ad3_0000","2da65ad3_0023","2da65ad3_0028","c730fa5c_0021","c730fa5c_0005"],"stop_reason":"answered","n_steps":3,"latency":{"total_s":5.787982000001648,"llm_s":5.252620300001581,"retrieve_s":0.5326372999988962,"tool_s":0.0,"n_llm_calls":3,"n_retrieve_calls":4,"n_tool_calls":0,"llm_call_s":[1.1627621000006911,0.8434268999990309,3.246431300001859],"overhead_s":0.0027244000011705793},"tokens":{"prompt":6893,"completion":665,"total":7558,"cache_hit":2944,"cache_miss":3949},"error":null,"response_model":"deepseek-flash","system_fingerprint":"aeb56401ca74e127821c4f9126dcb669","tool_sequence_collapsed":["retrieve"],"answer_sha1":"42b91b36f159"}
