{"run_id":"20260911T161706Z","sample_id":"cap_001","run_index":1,"k":5,"timestamp_utc":"2026-09-11T16:17:47+00:00","answer_type":"closed","question":"信贷风控项目里，PSI 达到多少会被判定为显著漂移并触发告警？","answer":"按项目技术规格书的约定，PSI 阈值分三档：\n\n- **< 0.1**：稳定\n- **0.1 ~ 0.25**：轻微漂移\n- **> 0.25**：显著漂移，触发告警\n\n所以判定为显著漂移并触发告警的线是 **PSI > 0.25**（阈值放在 config 里，可配置）。验收标准也是\"注入漂移后显著特征 PSI 越过告警线并被标记\"。","tool_sequence":["retrieve"],"retrieved_doc_ids":["c730fa5c_0027","c730fa5c_0028","c730fa5c_0004","c730fa5c_0037"],"stop_reason":"answered","n_steps":2,"latency":{"total_s":2.177076100000704,"llm_s":2.0487857999978587,"retrieve_s":0.12640259999898262,"tool_s":0.0,"n_llm_calls":2,"n_retrieve_calls":1,"n_tool_calls":0,"llm_call_s":[0.8085656999974162,1.2402201000004425],"overhead_s":0.0018877000038628466},"tokens":{"prompt":2078,"completion":161,"total":2239,"cache_hit":1664,"cache_miss":414},"error":null,"response_model":"deepseek-flash","system_fingerprint":"aeb56401ca74e127821c4f9126dcb669","tool_sequence_collapsed":["retrieve"],"answer_sha1":"92e90e9b6da4"}
