{"run_id":"20260911T161706Z","sample_id":"cap_035","run_index":1,"k":5,"timestamp_utc":"2026-09-11T16:18:06+00:00","answer_type":"open","question":"信贷风控项目的规格书里，要求用 Kubernetes 来编排服务吗？","answer":"**没有。** 规格书里没有要求用 Kubernetes。\n\n技术选型表中与部署相关的条目是：\n\n- **容器化**：Docker（+ 可选 docker-compose 同起 API 与 MLflow UI），理由是\"一键复现环境\"\n- **服务化**：FastAPI + Pydantic 校验 + Uvicorn\n- **CI/CD**：GitHub Actions（ruff + pytest）\n- **实验追踪**：MLflow 本地 file-based，明确说明\"无需起服务器\"\n\n整个项目的定位是本地落地（`D:\\xiangmu\\credit-risk-mlops`）并发布到 GitHub 的个人作品，编排层面只到 docker-compose，未涉及 Kubernetes。","tool_sequence":["retrieve","retrieve"],"retrieved_doc_ids":["c730fa5c_0005","c730fa5c_0000","c730fa5c_0010","c730fa5c_0023","c730fa5c_0035","c730fa5c_0006"],"stop_reason":"answered","n_steps":2,"latency":{"total_s":2.8256340000007185,"llm_s":2.560932499996852,"retrieve_s":0.2627848000047379,"tool_s":0.0,"n_llm_calls":2,"n_retrieve_calls":2,"n_tool_calls":0,"llm_call_s":[1.09858389999863,1.4623485999982222],"overhead_s":0.0019166999991284683},"tokens":{"prompt":2743,"completion":241,"total":2984,"cache_hit":768,"cache_miss":1975},"error":null,"response_model":"deepseek-flash","system_fingerprint":"aeb56401ca74e127821c4f9126dcb669","tool_sequence_collapsed":["retrieve"],"answer_sha1":"d501bcf4d57e"}
{"run_id":"20260911T161706Z","sample_id":"cap_001","run_index":2,"k":5,"timestamp_utc":"2026-09-11T16:18:09+00:00","answer_type":"closed","question":"信贷风控项目里，PSI 达到多少会被判定为显著漂移并触发告警？","answer":"按项目技术规格书的约定，PSI 阈值分三档：\n\n- **PSI < 0.1**：稳定\n- **PSI 0.1 ~ 0.25**：轻微漂移\n- **PSI > 0.25**：显著漂移，触发告警\n\n也就是说，**PSI 超过 0.25 会被判定为显著漂移并触发告警**（阈值放在 config 中，可配置）。验收标准也对应为：注入漂移后，显著特征的 PSI 越过告警线并被标记。\n\n补充说明：PSI 的计算方式是对每个特征比较\"参考分布（训练集）\"与\"当前分布（新到数据）\"，分桶后按 `Σ(当前占比−参考占比)·ln(当前占比/参考占比)` 计算。","tool_sequence":["retrieve","retrieve"],"retrieved_doc_ids":["c730fa5c_0027","c730fa5c_0028","c730fa5c_0004","c730fa5c_0034","c730fa5c_0037"],"stop_reason":"answered","n_steps":2,"latency":{"total_s":2.7613377000016044,"llm_s":2.5039665999938734,"retrieve_s":0.2554669000019203,"tool_s":0.0,"n_llm_calls":2,"n_retrieve_calls":2,"n_tool_calls":0,"llm_call_s":[1.0952882999990834,1.40867829999479],"overhead_s":0.0019042000058107078},"tokens":{"prompt":2997,"completion":260,"total":3257,"cache_hit":2560,"cache_miss":437},"error":null,"response_model":"deepseek-flash","system_fingerprint":"aeb56401ca74e127821c4f9126dcb669","tool_sequence_collapsed":["retrieve"],"answer_sha1":"f903ee0256db"}
