{"run_id":"20260911T161706Z","sample_id":"cap_001","run_index":4,"k":5,"timestamp_utc":"2026-09-11T16:18:44+00:00","answer_type":"closed","question":"信贷风控项目里，PSI 达到多少会被判定为显著漂移并触发告警？","answer":"按项目技术规格书的约定，PSI 阈值分三档：\n\n- **< 0.1**：稳定\n- **0.1 ~ 0.25**：轻微漂移\n- **> 0.25**：显著漂移，触发告警\n\n也就是说，**PSI 超过 0.25 会被判定为显著漂移并触发告警**（阈值放在 config 中，可配置）。验收标准也明确要求：注入漂移后，显著特征的 PSI 越过告警线并被标记。\n\n补充说明：PSI 的计算方式是对每个特征比较参考分布（训练集）与当前分布（新到数据），分桶后按 `Σ(当前占比−参考占比)·ln(当前占比/参考占比)` 计算。","tool_sequence":["retrieve","retrieve"],"retrieved_doc_ids":["c730fa5c_0027","c730fa5c_0028","c730fa5c_0004","c730fa5c_0034","c730fa5c_0037"],"stop_reason":"answered","n_steps":2,"latency":{"total_s":2.1585439999980736,"llm_s":1.893826400002581,"retrieve_s":0.2626058000023477,"tool_s":0.0,"n_llm_calls":2,"n_retrieve_calls":2,"n_tool_calls":0,"llm_call_s":[0.7645931000006385,1.1292333000019426],"overhead_s":0.002111799993144814},"tokens":{"prompt":2997,"completion":249,"total":3246,"cache_hit":2560,"cache_miss":437},"error":null,"response_model":"deepseek-flash","system_fingerprint":"aeb56401ca74e127821c4f9126dcb669","tool_sequence_collapsed":["retrieve"],"answer_sha1":"69b241e90c26"}
